      "id": "q-038",
      "question": "What am I working on with Nadia?",
      "actual_answer": {
        "type": "brief",
        "abstain": false,
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "summary": "Mostly Marten security work with Nadia (CISO): you and Dina assembled the Marten security review package by 9 Nov (delivery to Nadia unconfirmed); Nadia wants the Marten data-flow diagram from you and expects you to update the Marten timeline after her comments (both open); you are to look into the Marten timeout errors Nadia raised at the 8 Nov leads call, and to review Nadia's Marten integration spec. The joint Marten rollout checklist was dropped 8 Nov (superseded by the approach C decision) and the joint equity impact review was received by 8 Nov. Separately, Nadia asked you on 11 Nov to set up a coffee about pothole reporting (not set up yet).",
